# The repo-root .gitignore has a broad "_*/" rule, so we need a couple of
# exemptions for things that should be tracked:
!_tooling/
!*/simready/foundation/*/rules_and_reqs/_includes

# Generated requirements-enum package. build_hook.py always generates it into
# the tier's _build/python scratch (already ignored) for the wheel, and mirrors
# it here as well for editable installs, where a tier's regular-package
# __path__ is the only importable location. Never committed: it is derived from
# the capability markdown on every build.
*/simready/foundation/*/requirements/
